Type: Package
Package: diviana
Title: Shiny App for Disaster Victim Identification
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Magnus Dehli", "Vigeland", , "m.d.vigeland@medisin.uio.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9134-4962"))
Description: A 'shiny' application for DNA-based disaster victim
    identification and missing person cases, including families with
    multiple missing persons. Supports flexible data import, including
    'Familias' files, automatic pedigree creation from relationship tags,
    and interactive pedigree editing. Analyses include pairwise likelihood
    ratios, merging of post-mortem samples, exclusions, and joint (global)
    identification, based on methods described by Vigeland and Egeland
    (2021) <doi:10.1038/s41598-021-93071-5> and Egeland and Vigeland
    (2025) <doi:10.1016/j.fsigen.2025.103270>. Part of the 'pedsuite'
    collection of packages for pedigree analysis.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/magnusdv/diviana
